 "summary": "Adds a `rebroadcastwallettx` RPC method and a GUI context menu action to allow manual rebroadcasting of unconfirmed wallet transactions. The wallet extracts broadcast eligibility checks into a helper and submits the transaction to the mempool with immediate peer broadcast. It exposes these checks through the node-wallet interface to enable or disable the GUI context menu action.",
 "problem": "Users have no direct way in the wallet interface or RPC to manually rebroadcast an unconfirmed transaction that failed to propagate or dropped out of mempools. Today, doing so requires extracting the raw transaction hex and invoking `sendrawtransaction`.",
